(7034929, 1068419, 28427, '<td valign="top">What an original way to request a tip :) And it seems to work since the lady''s digging for one (or is she hiding for the photographer?). At first the horizontal line seems of, but when looking at the base of the church in the back, you see clearly it is not of at all.<br/>Nice b&amp;w conversion as well.  Overall a entry that gets a 9 from out here.</td>', 'What an original way to request a tip :) And it seems to work since the lady''s digging for one (or is she hiding for the photographer?). At first the horizontal line seems of, but when looking at the base of the church in the back, you see clearly it is not of at all.Nice b&w conversion as well.  Overall a entry that gets a 9 from out here.', '2013-05-09 13:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
