(7036235, 1068214, 100831, '<td valign="top">This makes ME sad... but I''m hoping this is part of the yearly cycle for them (not sure)... I''m noticing all their ears are perked, does that mean something?  <br/> <br/>Perhaps you would be interested in this <a href="//www.studio360.org/2013/may/10/isabella-rossellini-mammas/?utm_source=local&amp;utm_media=treatment&amp;utm_campaign=daMost&amp;utm_content=damostviewed" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">mammas</a> <br/>And maybe you can find the npr program I heard where she was interviewed... fascinating stuff.</td>', 'This makes ME sad... but I''m hoping this is part of the yearly cycle for them (not sure)... I''m noticing all their ears are perked, does that mean something?   Perhaps you would be interested in this mammas And maybe you can find the npr program I heard where she was interviewed... fascinating stuff.', '2013-05-12 22:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
