(7036448, 1068259, 114969, '<td valign="top">Having fun with the tilt-shift lens I see :-) Congratulations Robert on the great finish. I love the muddish tones you gave to the scene, gives it a strong mood.</td>', 'Having fun with the tilt-shift lens I see :-) Congratulations Robert on the great finish. I love the muddish tones you gave to the scene, gives it a strong mood.', '2013-05-13 08:23:39.000000', NULL, 0),
